<Base title="API · openRuyi Packages"><article class="prose"><h1>Query interface</h1><p>Requests read stored observations; they never start an upstream check. No account is required. <a href="/openapi.json">OpenAPI specification</a>.</p><dl class="api-list">
<dt><a href="/api/v1/packages">GET /api/v1/packages</a></dt><dd>Search with <code>q</code>. Use <code>view=all|updates|problems|attention</code>, <code>page</code>, and <code>per_page</code> (1–200).</dd>
<dt><a href="/api/v1/packages/bash">GET /api/v1/packages/{'{name}'}</a></dt><dd>Source version, observations, and all build flavors.</dd>
<dt><a href="/api/v1/tracks/meson">GET /api/v1/tracks/{'{id}'}</a></dt><dd>A configured native nvchecker entry.</dd>
<dt><a href="/api/v1/targets">GET /api/v1/targets</a></dt><dd>Display labels and exact OBS target identities.</dd>
<dt><a href="/api/v1/status">GET /api/v1/status</a></dt><dd>Collection status, coverage, and component errors.</dd>
<dt><a href="/api/v1/export">GET /api/v1/export</a></dt><dd>Download all package observations as JSON.</dd>
</dl><p>An absent package or track returns 404. An unknown version is null, not an empty success. An unavailable snapshot returns 503. Untracked does not mean up to date.</p></article></Base>
